    {
      "_comment": "ANIMALS — hunger 0=full, 100=starving. produce_timer counts down each fed tick (ticks per produce_interval days). fed_today resets each dawn. No death on hunger==100 (GDD: no punishing cascade). produce_timer init = produce_interval * ticks_per_day.",
